---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Testimonials from "../components/Testimonials.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Student Success Stories — IELTS Corner"
  description="Real success stories from IELTS and CELPIP students who reached their target scores with IELTS Corner tutoring and lessons."
  type="page"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: var(--s-6);">
    <div class="hero" style={`--hero-bg: url('/heroes/success.png');`}>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Students getting results</h1>
        <p>Real scores from real students using IELTS Corner.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

    <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
    <h2>What students say</h2>
    <Testimonials columns={3} />

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

    <!-- SUCCESS METRICS -->
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <article class="card" style="text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);">500+</div>
        <p style="margin: var(--s-1) 0 0; font-weight: 600;">Students Helped</p>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">From beginner to advanced levels</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card" style="text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);">98%</div>
        <p style="margin: var(--s-1) 0 0; font-weight: 600;">Satisfaction Rate</p>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">Would recommend to a friend</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card" style="text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);">+1.5</div>
        <p style="margin: var(--s-1) 0 0; font-weight: 600;">Average Score Jump</p>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">IELTS band increase</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

    <!-- DETAILED STORIES -->
    <div>
      <h2>How students achieved their goals</h2>

      <div class="stack" style="gap: var(--s-4);">
        <!-- STORY 1 -->
        <div class="grid grid-2" style="align-items: center; gap: var(--s-4);">
          <div>
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Priya: Band 6.5 → 7.5 in 8 weeks</h3>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Goal:</strong> Get into her target master's program</p>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Challenge:</strong> Struggled with grammar, especially conditionals and complex sentences. Ran out of time in writing and speaking.</p>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">What she did:</strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li>Used free grammar lessons to review problem areas</li>
              <li>Booked 12 tutoring hours over 8 weeks</li>
              <li>Had her essays corrected 3 times</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Result:</strong> +1.0 band score increase. Admitted to her program!</p>
            <p style="font-style: italic; color: var(--text-muted);">
              "I was so confused about conditionals. The free lessons explained it clearly, and tutoring gave me practice. Seeing the band score improve was so motivating."
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background: var(--surface); padding: var(--s-3); border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
            <div style="font-size: 3rem;">📈</div>
            <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: var(--s-1) 0;">6.5 → 7.5</p>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">8 weeks, 12 tutoring hours</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 2 -->
        <div class="grid grid-2" style="align-items: center; gap: var(--s-4);">
          <div style="background: var(--surface); padding: var(--s-3); border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
            <div style="font-size: 3rem;">🎤</div>
            <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: var(--s-1) 0;">CLB 8 → 9</p>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">6 weeks, 10 tutoring hours</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Ahmed: CLB 8 → 9 in CELPIP (Speaking focus)</h3>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Goal:</strong> Improve speaking score to qualify for immigration</p>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Challenge:</strong> Native speaker of Arabic. Accent affected understanding. Spoke too fast, didn't pause.</p>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">What he did:</strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li>Reviewed speaking lesson on pronunciation</li>
              <li>Booked 10 tutoring sessions (speaking practice)</li>
              <li>Did mock speaking tests with feedback</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Result:</strong> Reached CLB 9 in speaking. Immigration approved!</p>
            <p style="font-style: italic; color: var(--text-muted);">
              "Tutoring helped me sound more natural. The tips about pausing and emphasizing words actually worked in the real test."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 3 -->
        <div class="grid grid-2" style="align-items: center; gap: var(--s-4);">
          <div>
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Lisa: Band 6 → 7 (Writing 7.5) in 6 weeks</h3>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Goal:</strong> Improve from Band 6 to Band 7 overall</p>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Challenge:</strong> Writing was her skill. Scored 5.5 on writing section. Grammar errors and poor organization.</p>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">What she did:</strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li>Took free writing lessons on task types and time management</li>
              <li>Submitted 4 essays for correction (CA$15 each)</li>
              <li>Applied feedback and rewrote essays</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Result:</strong> Writing jumped from 5.5 → 7.5. Overall Band 7!</p>
            <p style="font-style: italic; color: var(--text-muted);">
              "The essay feedback was SO detailed. I knew exactly what to fix. Band score predictions were spot-on."
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background: var(--surface); padding: var(--s-3); border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
            <div style="font-size: 3rem;">✍️</div>
            <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: var(--s-1) 0;">5.5 → 7.5</p>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">Writing, 6 weeks, 4 essays</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- STORY 4 -->
        <div class="grid grid-2" style="align-items: center; gap: var(--s-4);">
          <div style="background: var(--surface); padding: var(--s-3); border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
            <div style="font-size: 3rem;">📚</div>
            <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); margin: var(--s-1) 0;">B1 → B2</p>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0;">12 weeks, self-study from lessons</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Marco: Self-study from B1 → B2 in 3 months</h3>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Goal:</strong> Improve English level for job advancement</p>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Challenge:</strong> Couldn't afford tutoring. Needed structured learning.</p>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">What he did:</strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li>Used free lessons organized by proficiency level</li>
              <li>Spent 1 hour per day on lessons (5 days/week)</li>
              <li>Did quiz exercises after each lesson</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Result:</strong> Reached B2 level. Got promoted at work!</p>
            <p style="font-style: italic; color: var(--text-muted);">
              "Free lessons were enough. Having everything organized by level made it easy to progress without a teacher."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div style="text-align: center; padding: var(--s-4); background: var(--accent-light); border-radius: 8px;">
      <h2>Your success story starts here</h2>
      <p>Whether you study alone with our free lessons or get personalized help with tutoring, we're here to help you reach your goal.</p>
      <div class="cluster" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: var(--s-2);">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons">Start free lessons →</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/tutoring">Book a tutor</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    }
  }
</style>
